---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Prose from '../components/ui/Prose.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Sustainability" description="Our sustainability policy: environmental, social and economic responsibility.">
  <Section width="narrow" space="lg">
    <Prose variant="legal">
      <h1>Sustainability</h1>
      <p class="lead">Accountability does not stop at our clients’ books. It extends to the communities we work in and the environment we share.</p>
      <h2>Introduction</h2>
      <p>Our commitment to sustainability is part of our business values. We recognise our responsibility to protect the environment, contribute to social development and promote economic sustainability. This policy sets out our goals and the measures we take to balance our operations with our environmental and social responsibilities.</p>
      <h2>Scope</h2>
      <p>This policy applies to all activities conducted by Hina Shahrukh &amp; Co., including those performed on our behalf by third parties. It is relevant to all employees, associates, contractors, suppliers and clients.</p>
      <h2>Environmental responsibility</h2>
      <p>We aim to minimise our impact on the environment by:</p>
      <ul>
      <li><strong>Resource efficiency:</strong> reducing our use of energy, water and materials, promoting conservation, and using renewable energy where possible.</li>
      <li><strong>Waste reduction:</strong> reusing, recycling and disposing of materials responsibly, and working to reduce our carbon footprint.</li>
      <li><strong>Sustainable procurement:</strong> sourcing responsibly and prioritising environmentally friendly products and suppliers who hold similar standards.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Social responsibility</h2>
      <p>We aim to contribute positively to the communities where we operate:</p>
      <ul>
      <li><strong>Community engagement:</strong> supporting local communities through engagement, charitable contributions and social projects.</li>
      <li><strong>Diversity and inclusion:</strong> maintaining a diverse, inclusive workplace that respects every individual. Discrimination and harassment are not tolerated.</li>
      <li><strong>Health and safety:</strong> providing a safe environment for employees, contractors and visitors, and continuously assessing and managing risks.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Economic responsibility</h2>
      <p>We recognise the importance of economic sustainability:</p>
      <ul>
      <li><strong>Ethical business practices:</strong> conducting all activities ethically and in compliance with relevant laws and regulations.</li>
      <li><strong>Long-term value creation:</strong> balancing profit with our environmental and social commitments.</li>
      <li><strong>Sustainable partnerships:</strong> working with partners and clients who share our commitment to responsible business.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Monitoring and reporting</h2>
      <ul>
      <li><strong>Performance monitoring:</strong> we track our sustainability performance through regular assessments and key performance indicators.</li>
      <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> we communicate our efforts to stakeholders and welcome feedback that helps us improve.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Policy review</h2>
      <p>We review this policy annually to keep it aligned with our goals and the evolving regulatory landscape.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:mail@hsco.pk">mail@hsco.pk</a>.</p>
    </Prose>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
